        "Pure 3NF normalized PostgreSQL schema with canonical foreign keys and domain CHECK constraints",
        "Embedded versioned database migrations with automatic execution and connection pooling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Background & External Integrations",
      "items": [
        "Daily cron scheduler firing at 17:00 WIB for unsubmitted timesheet push alerts",
